{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51994","headline":"青溪野老诗（题从《续古文苑》卷四） · 法琳","name":"青溪野老诗（题从《续古文苑》卷四）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元淑世位卑，长卿宦情寡。\n二顷且营田，三钱聊饮马。\n悬峰白云上，挂月青山下。\n中心欲有言，未得忘言者。\n（见法琳《辨正论》卷七，《大正藏》本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法琳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}